# GMS's 30+x% of the pool, and GMS's ninety-second cooldown. The shield half is
# dropped: nothing here counts blocked hits.
#
# Cast in place of a swing, and only when badly hurt -- which the Priest may
# never be. It is insurance rather than a rotation.
name: "Holy Magic Shell"
skill_order: 2
description: "Restores a percentage of your HP."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_PRIEST
max_level: 20
base_delay_ms: 720
cooldown_seconds: 90.0
base { heal_pct: 0.31 }
per_level { heal_pct: 0.01 }
